+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates as RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch documents. The library only supports RFC 6902 JSON Patch.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, implementing RFC 7386.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: apply an RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+New module `src/json-merge-patch.ts`, new export in `src/index.ts`, new tests, README entry.
